{
  "name": "dsh-voice-alert",
  "version": "0.4.18",
  "description": "让 DSH 干完活会开口说话：回合结束自动播报「完成 / 失败」，零配置内置 20 个音效（无需 API Key），也可克隆自己的音色。另有第三个「审批」音效槽位，但只能手动触发（/play?kind=approval），不会自动播报。| Make DSH speak when the job is done: automatic voice/sound alerts for done and failed turns, 20 built-in sounds with zero config, or clone your own voice. A third approval slot exists but is manual-only (/play?kind=approval) — nothing fires it automatically.",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "sideEffects": false,
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1",
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.py",
    "sfx/*.mp3",
    "assets/*.png",
    "test/**",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README-zh.md",
    "README-es.md",
    "README-pt.md",
    "README-hi.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "voice",
    "alert",
    "notify",
    "tts",
    "settings",
    "语音提醒",
    "音效提醒",
    "声音克隆"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-voice-alert.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-voice-alert#readme",
  "packageManager": "pnpm@11.7.0"
}
